  "description": "Upgrade your Chevy Silverado 1500 with this 6.6ft Low-profile Hard Tri-fold Tonneau Cover (2019-2026, W/O Multi-Flex Tailgate). Featuring a precise fit for seamless integration, it offers enhanced security and convenience. The durable FRP surface resists wear and water, while the internal Polypropylene honeycomb structure supports up to 400lbs. Protect your cargo from rain, snow, and dust, and prevent theft with a secure lock that only unlocks when the tailgate is open.\nFeatures\nLow-Profile Design with Everyday Utility: Flush-mounted for a tight, factory-style fit, this tonneau cover delivers a clean, streamlined look while securely protecting your cargo.\nEnhanced Sealing & Easy Installation: Upgraded drainage channels help keep water out, while the included front seal strip and clamp-on mounting system ensure a secure fit and smooth, hassle-free installation.\nOne-Hand Quick Release Access: Open your truck bed in seconds with a convenient quick-latch system—no need to walk around the truck. One-handed operation makes loading and unloading faster and easier.\nReliable All-Weather Protection: Built to handle rain, dust, and road debris, this tonneau cover features integrated drain tubes that direct water away, keeping your truck bed dry and your gear protected year-round.\n1-year Warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2019-2026 Chevy Silverado 1500 New Body with 6.6 Feet Bed .\nCompatible with 2019-2026 GMC Sierra 1500 New Body with 6.6 Feet Bed.",
